{"title":"Career Roadmap · Naturopathy Assistant","role":"Naturopathy Assistant","summary":"A Naturopathy Assistant supports qualified naturopathy, yoga and wellness professionals in delivering structured wellness programmes, maintaining client records, preparing therapy areas, supporting non-invasive wellness activities and monitoring routine programme requirements.","facts":{"Current degree":"B.Sc Yoga / Naturopathy / Health & Wellness"},"about":[],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"This is a relevant entry-level pathway, particularly for graduates interested in integrative wellness, preventive health, yoga, nutrition, lifestyle management and naturopathy-centre operations."},{"type":"note","label":"Important qualification boundary","text":"A general B.Sc in Yoga/Naturopathy/Wellness should not automatically be treated as equivalent to a professional naturopathy medical qualification. In India, roles involving diagnosis, treatment or independent clinical practice may have specific educational, institutional and regulatory requirements. A graduate should therefore target assistant, wellness-support and programme-coordination roles unless separately qualified for clinical practice."}]},{"heading":"Career Horizon","kind":"horizons","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Period","Career Stage","Main Focus"],"rows":[[{"text":"2026–2027"},{"text":"Student / Wellness Intern"},{"text":"Yoga, wellness, anatomy and naturopathy fundamentals"}],[{"text":"2027–2029"},{"text":"Naturopathy Assistant / Wellness Associate"},{"text":"Client support and supervised wellness services"}],[{"text":"2029–2032"},{"text":"Senior Wellness Associate / Therapy Coordinator"},{"text":"Programme delivery and client management"}],[{"text":"2032–2036"},{"text":"Wellness Programme Manager"},{"text":"Centre/programme operations"}],[{"text":"2036–2040"},{"text":"Wellness Centre Manager / Senior Specialist"},{"text":"Programme strategy and team management"}],[{"text":"2040–2046"},{"text":"Wellness Programme Director / Integrative Wellness Lead"},{"text":"Organisation-wide wellness programmes"}]]}]},{"heading":"What Does a Naturopathy Assistant Do?","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Depending on the organisation, responsibilities may include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Supporting qualified naturopathy practitioners"},{"text":"Preparing therapy rooms"},{"text":"Maintaining hygiene and safety"},{"text":"Supporting scheduled wellness sessions"},{"text":"Assisting with yoga and relaxation activities"},{"text":"Maintaining client records"},{"text":"Recording basic programme observations"},{"text":"Coordinating appointments"},{"text":"Supporting nutrition/wellness programmes"},{"text":"Educating clients on prescribed lifestyle routines"},{"text":"Maintaining equipment"},{"text":"Preparing wellness materials"},{"text":"Tracking programme attendance"},{"text":"Supporting follow-up communication"},{"text":"Coordinating multidisciplinary wellness teams"}]},{"type":"p","text":"The assistant should work within the scope assigned by the qualified professional."}]},{"heading":"Core Areas to Understand","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A strong graduate should develop knowledge across:"},{"type":"h","text":"Yoga"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Asanas"},{"text":"Pranayama"},{"text":"Relaxation"},{"text":"Meditation"},{"text":"Yoga philosophy"},{"text":"Basic anatomy"},{"text":"Safe practice principles"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Naturopathy"},{"type":"p","text":"Understand the concepts behind:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Hydrotherapy"},{"text":"Mud therapy"},{"text":"Sun/air-based wellness practices"},{"text":"Massage-related wellness approaches"},{"text":"Diet and lifestyle management"},{"text":"Natural health practices"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Wellness"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Sleep"},{"text":"Physical activity"},{"text":"Stress management"},{"text":"Healthy lifestyle"},{"text":"Behaviour change"},{"text":"Preventive wellness"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Nutrition"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Macronutrients"},{"text":"Micronutrients"},{"text":"Balanced diets"},{"text":"Hydration"},{"text":"Basic dietary assessment"}]}]},{"heading":"Build Skills During B.Sc","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Year 1 — Foundation"},{"type":"p","text":"Study:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Human anatomy"},{"text":"Physiology"},{"text":"Basic health science"},{"text":"Yoga fundamentals"},{"text":"Naturopathy principles"},{"text":"Nutrition fundamentals"},{"text":"Health and wellness"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Develop:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Communication"},{"text":"Observation"},{"text":"Documentation"},{"text":"Professional behaviour"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Project"},{"type":"h","text":"Lifestyle & Wellness Assessment"},{"type":"p","text":"Create an academic study analysing:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Physical activity"},{"text":"Sleep"},{"text":"Hydration"},{"text":"Dietary patterns"},{"text":"Stress-management habits"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Use anonymous/consented data and avoid making medical diagnoses."}]},{"heading":"Year 2 — Yoga + Wellness Practice","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Develop stronger skills in:"},{"type":"h","text":"Yoga"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Asana technique"},{"text":"Pranayama"},{"text":"Meditation"},{"text":"Relaxation techniques"},{"text":"Mobility"},{"text":"Flexibility"},{"text":"Basic contraindication awareness"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Wellness"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Lifestyle modification"},{"text":"Stress management"},{"text":"Sleep hygiene"},{"text":"Physical activity"},{"text":"Behaviour change"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Communication"},{"type":"p","text":"Develop:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Client interaction"},{"text":"Active listening"},{"text":"Professional boundaries"},{"text":"Session documentation"}]}]},{"heading":"Year 3 — Naturopathy + Client Support","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Study:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Hydrotherapy concepts"},{"text":"Nutrition and lifestyle"},{"text":"Wellness therapies"},{"text":"Basic therapeutic procedures within training scope"},{"text":"Hygiene and sanitation"},{"text":"Client safety"},{"text":"Record keeping"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Learn to support structured programmes under supervision."},{"type":"p","text":"Understand when a client should be referred to a qualified healthcare professional rather than handled within a wellness programme."}]},{"heading":"Year 4 — Professional Wellness Practice","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Build practical skills in:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Client intake"},{"text":"Wellness programme coordination"},{"text":"Session preparation"},{"text":"Progress tracking"},{"text":"Client communication"},{"text":"Documentation"},{"text":"Safety protocols"},{"text":"Centre operations"},{"text":"Digital health records"},{"text":"Wellness analytics"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Add:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Excel"},{"text":"Basic statistics"},{"text":"Power BI"},{"text":"Digital appointment/CRM systems"}]}]},{"heading":"Four-Year Development Plan","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Year","Focus","Practical Output"],"rows":[[{"text":"Year 1"},{"text":"Health + wellness foundation"},{"text":"Lifestyle assessment project"}],[{"text":"Year 2"},{"text":"Yoga + wellness"},{"text":"Structured wellness programme"}],[{"text":"Year 3"},{"text":"Naturopathy support"},{"text":"Supervised practical training"}],[{"text":"Year 4"},{"text":"Professional practice"},{"text":"Complete wellness programme portfolio"}]]}]},{"heading":"Practical Projects","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Project 1 — Wellness Programme Design"},{"type":"p","text":"Design a 4-week general wellness programme covering:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Yoga"},{"text":"Physical activity"},{"text":"Relaxation"},{"text":"Sleep habits"},{"text":"Hydration"},{"text":"Healthy lifestyle education"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Measure:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Attendance"},{"text":"Participation"},{"text":"Self-reported wellbeing"},{"text":"Programme adherence"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Do not claim that such a programme treats disease unless it is part of an appropriately supervised clinical programme."},{"type":"h","text":"Project 2 — Yoga Session Planning"},{"type":"p","text":"Create structured sessions for:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Beginners"},{"text":"Office workers"},{"text":"Older adults"},{"text":"Students"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Warm-up"},{"text":"Asanas"},{"text":"Breathing"},{"text":"Relaxation"},{"text":"Cool-down"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Adaptation should be based on appropriate professional guidance for people with medical conditions."},{"type":"h","text":"Project 3 — Wellness Progress Dashboard"},{"type":"p","text":"Use Excel/Power BI to track:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Attendance"},{"text":"Session completion"},{"text":"Programme adherence"},{"text":"Wellness goals"},{"text":"Client feedback"},{"text":"Follow-up status"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Project 4 — Wellness Centre Operations Study"},{"type":"p","text":"Analyse:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Appointment scheduling"},{"text":"Client flow"},{"text":"Room utilisation"},{"text":"Session duration"},{"text":"Staff allocation"},{"text":"Customer feedback"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Recommend operational improvements."},{"type":"h","text":"Project 5 — Nutrition Education Programme"},{"type":"p","text":"Create educational materials explaining:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Balanced meals"},{"text":"Hydration"},{"text":"Food groups"},{"text":"Healthy eating habits"},{"text":"Reading food labels"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Keep the content educational rather than presenting it as personalised medical nutrition therapy unless performed by an appropriately qualified professional."}]},{"heading":"Internships","kind":"internships","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Practical supervised experience is extremely valuable."},{"type":"p","text":"Target:"},{"type":"h","text":"Wellness centres"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Yoga centres"},{"text":"Naturopathy centres"},{"text":"Wellness resorts"},{"text":"Lifestyle centres"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Healthcare/integrative settings"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Hospitals with appropriate integrative wellness programmes"},{"text":"Rehabilitation/wellness centres"},{"text":"Preventive health programmes"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Corporate wellness"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Corporate wellness providers"},{"text":"Employee wellbeing programmes"},{"text":"Fitness and lifestyle companies"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Education"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Yoga/wellness institutions"},{"text":"Research centres"},{"text":"Community health programmes"}]}]},{"heading":"Internship Roles to Target","kind":"internships","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Search for:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Naturopathy Intern"},{"text":"Wellness Intern"},{"text":"Yoga Intern"},{"text":"Wellness Programme Intern"},{"text":"Therapy Assistant Intern"},{"text":"Health & Wellness Intern"},{"text":"Lifestyle Programme Intern"},{"text":"Wellness Coordinator Intern"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Prioritise placements with qualified supervision and clearly defined responsibilities."}]},{"heading":"Professional Learning","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Priority 1 — Yoga"},{"type":"p","text":"Develop competency in:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Asana"},{"text":"Pranayama"},{"text":"Meditation"},{"text":"Relaxation"},{"text":"Yoga safety"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Priority 2 — Anatomy & Physiology"},{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Musculoskeletal system"},{"text":"Cardiovascular system"},{"text":"Respiratory system"},{"text":"Nervous system"},{"text":"Basic human physiology"}]},{"type":"p","text":"This helps with safe wellness practice and communication."},{"type":"h","text":"Priority 3 — Nutrition"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Basic nutrition"},{"text":"Food groups"},{"text":"Hydration"},{"text":"Energy balance"},{"text":"Healthy dietary patterns"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Priority 4 — Client Safety"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Basic first aid"},{"text":"Emergency recognition"},{"text":"Infection control"},{"text":"Hygiene"},{"text":"Safe equipment use"},{"text":"Referral procedures"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Priority 5 — Data & Administration"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Excel"},{"text":"Basic statistics"},{"text":"Power BI"},{"text":"Digital records"},{"text":"Appointment management"}]}]},{"heading":"Jobs You Can Be Hired For","kind":"careers","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"After B.Sc + practical training, potential entry-level roles include:"},{"type":"h","text":"Wellness"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Naturopathy Assistant"},{"text":"Wellness Associate"},{"text":"Wellness Assistant"},{"text":"Wellness Programme Assistant"},{"text":"Lifestyle Programme Assistant"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Yoga"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Yoga Centre Assistant"},{"text":"Yoga Programme Coordinator"},{"text":"Yoga Wellness Associate"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Operations"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Wellness Coordinator"},{"text":"Wellness Centre Executive"},{"text":"Client Wellness Coordinator"},{"text":"Health & Wellness Executive"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Programme Support"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Wellness Programme Associate"},{"text":"Preventive Wellness Associate"},{"text":"Corporate Wellness Associate"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Exact titles and scope vary by organisation."}]},{"heading":"Employer-Ready Skill Stack","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Category","Skills"],"rows":[[{"text":"Yoga"},{"text":"Asanas, pranayama, relaxation"}],[{"text":"Naturopathy"},{"text":"Wellness principles and supervised therapies"}],[{"text":"Health"},{"text":"Anatomy, physiology, basic health science"}],[{"text":"Nutrition"},{"text":"Basic nutrition and healthy lifestyle"}],[{"text":"Client Care"},{"text":"Communication, observation, support"}],[{"text":"Safety"},{"text":"First aid, hygiene, referral awareness"}],[{"text":"Documentation"},{"text":"Client records, session notes"}],[{"text":"Operations"},{"text":"Scheduling, coordination"}],[{"text":"Data"},{"text":"Excel, basic statistics, Power BI"}],[{"text":"Professional"},{"text":"Ethics, boundaries, teamwork"}]]}]},{"heading":"Important Scope-of-Practice Boundary","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A Naturopathy Assistant should not independently:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Diagnose diseases"},{"text":"Prescribe medicines"},{"text":"Claim to cure medical conditions"},{"text":"Replace a physician or qualified healthcare professional"},{"text":"Provide regulated clinical treatment without the required qualification"},{"text":"Change a patient's medical treatment plan"}]},{"type":"p","text":"The assistant can support wellness and supervised programmes within the role's defined scope."},{"type":"p","text":"For clients with significant symptoms, chronic disease, pregnancy-related concerns, medication issues or other medical risks, appropriate referral to a qualified healthcare professional is essential."}]},{"heading":"Postgraduate Options in India","kind":"pg_india","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"The right postgraduate pathway depends on whether the student wants wellness management, yoga specialisation, research or clinical naturopathy."},{"type":"h","text":"Option 1 — M.Sc Yoga"},{"type":"p","text":"Useful for:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Advanced yoga"},{"text":"Yoga education"},{"text":"Wellness programmes"},{"text":"Yoga research"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Option 2 — M.Sc Yoga & Wellness"},{"type":"p","text":"Useful for:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Lifestyle programmes"},{"text":"Corporate wellness"},{"text":"Wellness centres"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Option 3 — Master's in Public Health"},{"type":"p","text":"Useful for:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Preventive health"},{"text":"Community wellness"},{"text":"Health promotion"},{"text":"Public-health programmes"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Option 4 — Nutrition / Dietetics"},{"type":"p","text":"Useful for:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Wellness nutrition"},{"text":"Lifestyle programmes"},{"text":"Health education"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Specific clinical nutrition practice may have additional qualification requirements."},{"type":"h","text":"Option 5 — MBA Healthcare / Wellness Management"},{"type":"p","text":"Useful for:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Wellness-centre management"},{"text":"Healthcare operations"},{"text":"Corporate wellness"},{"text":"Business development"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Option 6 — Professional Naturopathy Qualification"},{"type":"p","text":"Students specifically seeking to become qualified naturopathy practitioners should investigate recognised professional programmes such as the appropriate naturopathy/yoga medical degree pathway rather than assuming a general B.Sc provides equivalent clinical eligibility."},{"type":"p","text":"Current institutional and regulatory requirements should be verified before enrolling."}]},{"heading":"Study Abroad","kind":"abroad","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Relevant postgraduate areas include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Yoga Studies"},{"text":"Mind-Body Medicine"},{"text":"Wellness Management"},{"text":"Public Health"},{"text":"Health Promotion"},{"text":"Integrative Health"},{"text":"Lifestyle Medicine"},{"text":"Health & Wellness Management"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Potential destinations:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"USA"},{"text":"UK"},{"text":"Australia"},{"text":"Canada"},{"text":"Germany"},{"text":"New Zealand"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Professional recognition varies substantially across countries, so verify whether the programme leads to the scope of practice you intend to pursue."}]},{"heading":"Career Specialisations","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Track 1 — Yoga & Wellness"},{"type":"p","text":"Focus:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Yoga"},{"text":"Meditation"},{"text":"Stress management"},{"text":"Corporate wellness"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Track 2 — Wellness Programme Coordination"},{"type":"p","text":"Focus:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Programme planning"},{"text":"Client management"},{"text":"Scheduling"},{"text":"Outcomes tracking"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Track 3 — Corporate Wellness"},{"type":"p","text":"Work with organisations on:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Employee wellbeing"},{"text":"Stress management"},{"text":"Physical activity"},{"text":"Workplace wellness"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Track 4 — Wellness Centre Management"},{"type":"p","text":"Focus:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Operations"},{"text":"Staff coordination"},{"text":"Client experience"},{"text":"Programme management"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Track 5 — Wellness Research"},{"type":"p","text":"Focus:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Yoga research"},{"text":"Lifestyle interventions"},{"text":"Behaviour change"},{"text":"Preventive health"},{"text":"Health outcomes"}]}]},{"heading":"Career Progression","kind":"growth","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Wellness Path"},{"type":"h","text":"B.Sc Yoga / Naturopathy / Wellness"},{"type":"h","text":"Wellness Intern"},{"type":"h","text":"Naturopathy Assistant / Wellness Associate"},{"type":"h","text":"Senior Wellness Associate"},{"type":"h","text":"Wellness Programme Coordinator"},{"type":"h","text":"Wellness Centre Manager"},{"type":"h","text":"Senior Wellness Manager"},{"type":"h","text":"Wellness Programme Director"},{"type":"h","text":"Yoga Specialisation"},{"type":"h","text":"B.Sc"},{"type":"h","text":"Yoga/Wellness Assistant"},{"type":"h","text":"Yoga Wellness Professional"},{"type":"h","text":"Senior Yoga Professional / Programme Coordinator"},{"type":"h","text":"Yoga Programme Manager"},{"type":"h","text":"Wellness Director"},{"type":"p","text":"Further clinical or therapeutic roles depend on the qualification and applicable professional requirements."}]},{"heading":"Research Directions","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"For students interested in research:"},{"type":"h","text":"Yoga"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Yoga and stress"},{"text":"Yoga and sleep"},{"text":"Yoga and physical wellbeing"},{"text":"Mind-body interventions"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Naturopathy"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Lifestyle interventions"},{"text":"Preventive health"},{"text":"Behaviour change"},{"text":"Integrative wellness"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Public Health"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Community wellness"},{"text":"Health promotion"},{"text":"Preventive health programmes"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Technology"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Digital yoga platforms"},{"text":"Wearable-based wellness"},{"text":"AI-assisted wellness coaching"},{"text":"Personalised lifestyle programmes"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Research involving medical claims should follow appropriate ethical and clinical research standards."}]},{"heading":"2040–2046: Future of Wellness","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Wellness is moving from generic programmes toward personalised, data-supported lifestyle management."},{"type":"p","text":"Traditional:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Wellness programme","Sessions","General advice"]},{"type":"p","text":"Future:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Wearables","activity data","sleep data","personalised programmes","digital coaching"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"Potential technologies include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Wearable health devices"},{"text":"AI wellness assistants"},{"text":"Digital yoga platforms"},{"text":"Personalised wellness plans"},{"text":"Remote wellness coaching"},{"text":"Behaviour-change analytics"},{"text":"Virtual reality relaxation"},{"text":"AI-assisted programme tracking"}]},{"type":"p","text":"However, AI and wellness technology should support qualified professionals rather than replace medical diagnosis or treatment."}]},{"heading":"Recommended Final Skill Stack","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Yoga"},{"type":"h","text":"Naturopathy Fundamentals"},{"type":"h","text":"Anatomy & Physiology"},{"type":"h","text":"Nutrition Fundamentals"},{"type":"h","text":"Wellness Programme Management"},{"type":"h","text":"Client Communication"},{"type":"h","text":"First Aid & Safety"},{"type":"h","text":"Professional Ethics"},{"type":"h","text":"Excel + Basic Statistics"},{"type":"h","text":"Power BI"},{"type":"h","text":"Digital Wellness Tools"},{"type":"h","text":"Evidence-Based Practice"}]},{"heading":"Ideal Graduate Profile","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"By graduation, the student should be able to:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Explain fundamental yoga and wellness principles."},{"text":"Understand basic anatomy and physiology."},{"text":"Support structured yoga/wellness sessions."},{"text":"Assist qualified professionals with assigned naturopathy activities."},{"text":"Maintain accurate client/programme records."},{"text":"Communicate professionally with clients."},{"text":"Recognise situations requiring professional referral."},{"text":"Follow hygiene and safety procedures."},{"text":"Track programme participation and outcomes."},{"text":"Prepare wellness programme reports."},{"text":"Use basic data analytics for programme monitoring."},{"text":"Understand the boundary between wellness support and regulated clinical practice."}]},{"type":"h","text":"Best Practical Path"},{"type":"h","text":"B.Sc Yoga / Naturopathy / Health & Wellness"},{"type":"flow","items":["Supervised Wellness/Naturopathy Internship","Yoga + Anatomy + Nutrition + Safety","Client Support + Programme Coordination","Naturopathy Assistant / Wellness Associate","Senior Wellness Associate","Wellness Programme Coordinator","Wellness Centre Manager / Corporate Wellness Specialist","Wellness Programme Director"]},{"type":"note","label":"For independent clinical naturopathy practice","text":"pursue the appropriate recognised professional qualification and registration/eligibility pathway, rather than relying on the general B.Sc alone."}]}]}